# Keywords, prose runs (before any heading included), and the
# property drawer directly under its heading.

exec babble parse --dump b.org
cmp stdout want.json

-- b.org --
#+title: a tiny book
#+author: me

Leading prose before any heading,
two lines of it.

* Section
:PROPERTIES:
:header-args: :comments org
:CUSTOM_ID: sec
:END:

Body prose.

#+caption: not a block, just a keyword
More prose after a keyword.
